msgid "read-only PAT or `GITHUB_TOKEN` (provider reads only)"
msgstr "読み取り専用PATまたは `GITHUB_TOKEN`（プロバイダは読み取りのみ）"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "`terraform plan` (drift check)"
msgstr "`terraform plan`（ドリフトチェック）"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "CI scheduled (weekly)"
msgstr "CIスケジュール（週次）"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
