msgid "`terraform apply`"
msgstr "`terraform apply`"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "local, after merge"
msgstr "ローカル、マージ後"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "maintainer"
msgstr "メンテナ"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "short-lived PAT, scoped, revoked after"
msgstr "短命PAT、スコープ付き、後に失効"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "State storage"
msgstr "状態ストレージ"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "committed `terraform.tfstate`"
msgstr "コミットされた `terraform.tfstate`"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "Git"
msgstr "Git"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md
msgid "n/a"
msgstr "該当なし"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:127
msgid "Drift reconciliation"
msgstr "ドリフト調整"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:129
msgid ""
"When the scheduled `terraform plan -detailed-exitcode` reports a diff "
"(exit code 2), the workflow opens (or updates) a GitHub issue listing the"
" drift. A maintainer then either:"
msgstr "スケジュールされた `terraform plan -detailed-exitcode` がdiff（終了コード2）を報告した場合、ワークフローはドリフトを一覧したGitHub issueを開く（または更新する）。メンテナは次のいずれかを行う:"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:131
msgid ""
"reverts the manual GitHub UI change so the live state matches the "
"committed configuration, or"
msgstr "手動のGitHub UI変更を元に戻してライブ状態がコミットされた設定と一致するようにする、または"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:132
msgid ""
"imports the manual change into Terraform by editing `main.tf` to declare "
"the resource/setting and running `terraform apply` locally to commit the "
"updated state."
msgstr "`main.tf` を編集してリソース/設定を宣言しローカルで `terraform apply` を実行して更新された状態をコミットすることで手動変更をTerraformにインポートする。"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:134
msgid "Token scope and safety"
msgstr "トークンスコープと安全性"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:136
msgid ""
"The CI `plan` step uses a read-only PAT (or the default `GITHUB_TOKEN` if"
" the provider supports it for the resources declared) with the minimum "
"scope needed to read repository settings."
msgstr "CI `plan` ステップは読み取り専用PAT（または宣言されたリソースについてプロバイダがサポートする場合はデフォルトの `GITHUB_TOKEN`）をリポジトリ設定を読み取るのに必要な最小スコープで使用する。"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:137
msgid ""
"The local `apply` step uses a classic or fine-grained PAT issued from the"
" maintainer's account with `repo` scope (and `admin:org` only if org-"
"level resources are declared), valid for the shortest lifetime GitHub "
"allows, and revoked immediately after the apply completes."
msgstr "ローカル `apply` ステップはメンテナのアカウントから発行された `repo` スコープ（orgレベルリソースが宣言された場合のみ `admin:org`）を持つクラシックまたはファイングレインPATを使用しGitHubが許す最短の有効期間でapply完了直後に失効する。"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:138
msgid ""
"The `integrations/github` provider reads the token from the "
"`GITHUB_TOKEN` environment variable at runtime; it is never written into "
"`terraform.tfstate`. The state file is therefore safe to commit, but is "
"reviewed in PRs like any other change to confirm no sensitive field "
"leaks."
msgstr "`integrations/github` プロバイダは実行時に `GITHUB_TOKEN` 環境変数からトークンを読み取る — `terraform.tfstate` に書き込まれることはない。したがって状態ファイルはコミットしても安全だが他の変更と同様にPRでレビューされ機密フィールドの漏洩がないことを確認する。"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:140
msgid "Upgrade path"
msgstr "アップグレードパス"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:142
msgid ""
"If the maintainer team grows beyond one or state locking becomes "
"necessary, upgrade to a remote backend with locking (e.g., S3+DynamoDB or"
" HCP Terraform) and move `apply` into CI with OIDC. The committed "
"`terraform.tfstate` can be imported into the remote backend with "
"`terraform state pull` / `terraform state push`, so the chosen option "
"does not lock the project out of upgrading."
msgstr "メンテナチームが1人を超えて成長するか状態ロックが必要になった場合、ロック付きリモートバックエンド（例: S3+DynamoDBまたはHCP Terraform）にアップグレードし `apply` をOIDC付きCIに移行する。コミットされた `terraform.tfstate` は `terraform state pull` / `terraform state push` でリモートバックエンドにインポートでき、選択肢はプロジェクトをアップグレードから排除しない。"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:144
msgid "Links"
msgstr "リンク"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:146
msgid ""
"`integrations/github` provider: "
"[https://registry.terraform.io/providers/integrations/github/latest/docs](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/integrations/github/latest/docs)"
msgstr "`integrations/github` プロバイダ: [https://registry.terraform.io/providers/integrations/github/latest/docs](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/integrations/github/latest/docs)"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:147
msgid ""
"GitHub Actions OIDC: [https://docs.github.com/en/actions/deployment"
"/security-hardening-your-deployments/about-security-hardening-with-"
"openid-connect](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/deployment/security-"
"hardening-your-deployments/about-security-hardening-with-openid-connect)"
msgstr "GitHub Actions OIDC: [https://docs.github.com/en/actions/deployment/security-hardening-your-deployments/about-security-hardening-with-openid-connect](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/deployment/security-hardening-your-deployments/about-security-hardening-with-openid-connect)"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:148
msgid ""
"HCP Terraform: [https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cloud-"
"docs](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cloud-docs)"
msgstr "HCP Terraform: [https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cloud-docs](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/cloud-docs)"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:149
msgid ""
"Parent story: [#513](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-"
"wasm/issues/513) (Manage and sync GitHub repository settings with "
"Terraform)"
msgstr "親ストーリー: [#513](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-wasm/issues/513)（TerraformでGitHubリポジトリ設定を管理・同期）"

#: ../../decisions/0009-decide-how-to-sync-github-repo-settings-with-terraform.md:150
msgid ""
"This decision: [#514](https://github.com/tkoyama010/pyvista-"
